// What a package shader's embedded source includes after each program's text: declarations an older engine's includes
// had and today's don't, each only where the package uses it and its include is in (the converter sets the
// SBOX_EMBEDDED_* defines from the package's text; Slang finds declarations wherever they are in the module).
// See docs/managed/pass-modules.md, "Shaders an older engine compiled".
#ifndef SBOX_EMBEDDED_END_SLANGH
#define SBOX_EMBEDDED_END_SLANGH

